    <p>This site has no cookies, no analytics and no tracking. Its fonts and images are served from the site itself. It is hosted on GitHub Pages, which keeps ordinary server logs (such as IP addresses) for security.</p>
    <p>If you join the email list, your address is stored by Kit (kit.com), the service that sends the emails. It is used only to send news about {{ site.name }}. Every email has an unsubscribe link, and unsubscribing removes you from the list. Your address is never sold or shared.</p>
    <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a></p>
